['Can I return an order?','Start the return with TrendMix. You will then receive the return instructions and return address that apply to your order.'],
['Who helps if there is a problem with my order?','TrendMix remains the customer contact point. Use the contact form with your order details and a clear description of the issue.'],
['Why can price and stock change?','The current catalog is a test selection. Final price, stock and delivery information will come from the selected supplier.'],
['Are product images and specifications final?','Not for every product. Final images, brands and specifications will be checked when the supplier is connected.'],
['Does TrendMix use fabricated reviews?','No. TrendMix does not display fabricated reviews or ratings.'],
['Does TrendMix use cookies?','TrendMix uses local preferences such as the selected language. Final cookie configuration will reflect the services actually used at launch.'],
['What data does TrendMix collect?','See the privacy and cookie pages for the current explanation. They will be updated before launch to reflect the services actually used.'],
['How can I report incorrect product information?','Use the contact form. We will check the product information and correct it where needed.']
